).$ Therefore, $\\lambda =\\frac{1}{2},$ and\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[X]=\\frac{1}{(\\frac{1}{2})}\\,\\text{min}=2\\,\\text{min}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the average time until the next visitor is $2$ minutes." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-e7049d2d-fc9f-5f20-8e5c-02896d997034"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-e7049d2d-fc9f-5f20-8e5c-02896d997034" :answer-field/id #uuid "e7049d2d-fc9f-5f20-8e5c-02896d997034" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-d06dab70-fbd9-57eb-9947-fb23ab39c34e" :answer-field/choices ["answer-33219482-ef34-597b-b10a-a5cf5d960dda" "answer-13aa5558-5072-53e7-bd58-cf7c7ba5a133" "answer-d06dab70-fbd9-57eb-9947-fb23ab39c34e" "answer-8acfbc95-a05b-5d37-8140-8a62e5da7a2a" "answer-530f6bf8-4fcb-5c94-9cee-6007d643f0f6"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-33219482-ef34-597b-b10a-a5cf5d960dda" :answer/id #uuid "33219482-ef34-597b-b10a-a5cf5d960dda" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$1$ minute" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-13aa5558-5072-53e7-bd58-cf7c7ba5a133" :answer/id #uuid "13aa5558-5072-53e7-bd58-cf7c7ba5a133" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$15$ seconds" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d06dab70-fbd9-57eb-9947-fb23ab39c34e" :answer/id #uuid "d06dab70-fbd9-57eb-9947-fb23ab39c34e" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$2$ minutes" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8acfbc95-a05b-5d37-8140-8a62e5da7a2a" :answer/id #uuid "8acfbc95-a05b-5d37-8140-8a62e5da7a2a" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$30$ seconds" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-530f6bf8-4fcb-5c94-9cee-6007d643f0f6" :answer/id #uuid "530f6bf8-4fcb-5c94-9cee-6007d643f0f6" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$4$ minutes" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-7ced14e8-8144-5a90-a159-85ee1ea70744" :question/id #uuid "7ced14e8-8144-5a90-a159-85ee1ea70744" :question/math-academy-id "q-138314" :question/problem "The time $X,$ in weeks, between two grandkids visiting their grandma can be modeled as an exponential random variable $X∼\\text{Exp}(7).$ If a grandkid has just visited their grandma, what is the average time until the next grandkid visits their grandma?" :question/worked-solution "Recall that if $X∼\\text{Exp}(\\lambda )$ is an exponential random variable, then\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[X]=\\frac{1}{\\lambda }.\n$$\n\nWe're given that $X∼\\text{Exp}(7).$ Therefore, $\\lambda =7,$ which means that grandkids visit their grandma at an average rate of $7$ visits per week. Hence,\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[X]=\\frac{1}{7}\\,\\text{week}=1\\,\\text{day}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the average time until the next grandkid's visit is $1$ day." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-972739f9-2ca7-5e51-8be2-cdc627574abe"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-972739f9-2ca7-5e51-8be2-cdc627574abe" :answer-field/id #uuid "972739f9-2ca7-5e51-8be2-cdc627574abe" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-ac92feca-9b24-5ba3-8997-1c3b5fdc560b" :answer-field/choices ["answer-ac92feca-9b24-5ba3-8997-1c3b5fdc560b" "answer-991ebd97-1bba-53d6-8eb0-37ded272c11a" "answer-894f80a8-661c-52a9-bf68-6f0f805aa1ac" "answer-bba18b49-af2d-51f5-a5ee-8ea2b7824778" "answer-2fe74356-49b8-543c-8d6e-d896f6be8ab6"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ac92feca-9b24-5ba3-8997-1c3b5fdc560b" :answer/id #uuid "ac92feca-9b24-5ba3-8997-1c3b5fdc560b" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$1$ day" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-991ebd97-1bba-53d6-8eb0-37ded272c11a" :answer/id #uuid "991ebd97-1bba-53d6-8eb0-37ded272c11a" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$1$ week" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-894f80a8-661c-52a9-bf68-6f0f805aa1ac" :answer/id #uuid "894f80a8-661c-52a9